tion, outsourcing, or partner procurement model.', 'HIGH', '', '{"projectsWorkTypes":"KNOWN: Public positioning indicates architecture and design work across commercial, workplace, hospitality, and residential projects. The website reportedly presents a portfolio of distinctive projects.","commercialFocus":"KNOWN: Commercial relevance is indicated through workplace, office-related, and hospitality project categories. INFERRED: This may include repeat commercial fit-out opportunities, but project volume and execution responsibility are unverified.","residentialFocus":"KNOWN: Residential projects are included in the stated portfolio. INFERRED: The firm''s premium residential relevance is plausible from the described design-led positioning, but the premium segment is not independently verified.","dnbCapability":"UNKNOWN: No reliable public evidence has been provided confirming design-and-build, turnkey delivery, construction management, fabrication, or manufacturing capability.","meavenFit":"KNOWN: Strong match for Meaven''s target category and Bangalore geography. INFERRED: Commercial design work could create execution collaboration opportunities, but no public evidence confirms external-partner usage.","geographicRelevance":"KNOWN: The candidate is identified as Bangalore-based, matching the requested Bangalore target geography. The official website domain is clearly identifiable.","companySize":"INFERRED: The firm is described as a relatively focused or boutique studio. UNKNOWN: Exact headcount, operating capacity, and organizational structure are not verified."}'::jsonb, 'job-1790091601657-n4il', '[{"claim":"Verified active website: Studio Motley","sourceUrl":"https://www.studiomotley.com/","sourceTitle":"Studio Motley — Official Website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"KNOWN"},{"claim":"The firm''s stated or presented portfolio includes commercial, workplace, hospitality, and residential projects.","sourceUrl":"https://www.studiomotley.com/","sourceTitle":"Studio Motley — Official Website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"KNOWN"},{"claim":"Studio Motley is a boutique or relatively focused practice.","sourceUrl":"https://www.studiomotley.com/","sourceTitle":"Studio Motley — Official Website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"INFERRED"},{"claim":"The firm could potentially become a repeat Meaven execution partner.","sourceUrl":"https://www.studiomotley.com/","sourceTitle":"Studio Motley — Official Website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"UNKNOWN"},{"claim":"Studio Motley uses external vendors, subcontractors, or specialist execution partners.","sourceUrl":"https://www.studiomotley.com/","sourceTitle":"Studio Motley — Official Website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"UNKNOWN"},{"claim":"Studio Motley provides turnkey or design-and-build execution.","sourceUrl":"https://www.studiomotley.com/","sourceTitle":"Studio Motley — Official Website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"UNKNOWN"}]'::jsonb, 'Verified: Active website confirmed for Studio Motley (studiomotley.com).', '["Boutique architecture and interior design studio","Design-led positioning","Commercial project capability","Workplace and hospitality project capability","Premium residential project capability","Execution model not publicly verified"]'::jsonb, 'UNKNOWN', 'The firm is a strong ICP and project-type match, but the available evidence does not establish whether Studio Motley uses external execution partners, outsources specialist scopes, manages repeat build-outs, or maintains a vendor ecosystem. Partner potential therefore remains unverified rather than high or low.', '"Publicly available information supplied for review confirms the firm''s positioning and portfolio categories but does not verify company size, completed-project delivery responsibilities, in-house versus outsourced execution, procurement practices, project volume, geographic coverage beyond Bangalore, or openness to backend execution partnerships."'::jsonb, '["⚠️ Verif