t design-led project delivery across multiple work types.","sourceUrl":"https://mayapraxis.com/","sourceTitle":"Maya Praxis official website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"INFERRED"},{"claim":"The firm uses external execution partners, subcontractors, vendors, or specialist installers.","sourceUrl":"https://mayapraxis.com/","sourceTitle":"Maya Praxis official website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"UNKNOWN"},{"claim":"The firm has recurring commercial project volume that could create repeat Meaven execution demand.","sourceUrl":"https://mayapraxis.com/","sourceTitle":"Maya Praxis official website","dateCaptured":"2026-09-22","status":"UNKNOWN"}]'::jsonb, 'Verified: Active website confirmed for Maya Praxis (mayapraxis.com).', '["Architecture and interior design studio","Built project portfolio claimed","Commercial project capability claimed","Hospitality project capability claimed","Multidisciplinary capability claimed","In-house execution status unknown","Design-and-build capability unknown","External vendor or subcontractor model unknown"]'::jsonb, 'UNKNOWN', 'The firm appears relevant for Meaven based on its commercial, hospitality, institutional, and residential portfolio signals, but the available evidence does not establish recurring execution demand, outsourcing, specialist vendor use, overflow capacity needs, or an external partner ecosystem. Partner potential should therefore remain UNKNOWN until the firm''s delivery model and procurement practices are verified.', '"The supplied evidence identifies the company, location, service category, and broad project types, but does not independently verify project names, completion dates, project scale, current workload, commercial specialization, design-build capabilities, manufacturing, subcontracting, or use of external execution partners. Specific office, coworking, retail, and premium residential examples should be validated from the website and project references."'::jsonb, '["⚠️ Verify that the website is the official operating domain for the Bangalore practice and confirm the legal/company identity.","⚠️ Validate named completed projects, completion dates, project locations, and Maya Praxis''s exact scope of work.","⚠️ Confirm whether commercial work includes offices, coworking spaces, retail, and hospitality projects rather than only broad category labels.","⚠️ Determine whether the firm provides design-only services, turnkey delivery, design-and-build, or project management.","⚠️ Ask whether specialist execution, overflow work, glass, interiors, fabrication, installation, or site packages are outsourced to external partners.","⚠️ Assess whether the firm has recurring commercial project volume that could support a repeat Meaven partnership."]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

